SUMMARY:Belles & Chimes Flip Frenzy
DESCRIPTION:Spinning off from our monthly Belles & Chimes Women’s Pinball
  Meetup is a new monthly Belles Flip Frenzy happening throughout the year!
  A morning of manic head to head pinball for women and non-binary persons.
  Over the course of roughly 3 hours\, you’ll be pitted against a variety
  of opponents on a large selection of pinball machines. Win or lose then m
 ove game and opponent. Expect to play around 20 games each with the player
  with the most wins at the end of the whirlwind competition taking top pla
 ce. Top 8 will then compete in a double elimination bracelet final. Doors 
 open at 8am with all games on free play for warm up. There’ll be a rules
  rundown at 8:45 with the comp starting at 9am sharp. Tickets includes ent
 ry to the comp and your first drink. Grab them via www.netherworldarcade.c
 om !
LOCATION:Netherworld\, 186 Brunswick Street
URL:https://www.netherworldarcade.com/event/belles-chimes-flip-frenzy-2/
END:VEVENT
